	(text "IR HEADSET - LTE INTERFACE BOARD (2-layer)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.54 2.54)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "acef234a-7942-4091-8e18-16871295e8b9")
	)
	(text "Plugs into the Open-Q 624A development kit J1 (External Codec/GPIO Expansion Header)\nthrough a 40-way ribbon. All parts are through-hole or 0805/1206/SOT-23 for home fabrication.\nVerify J1's pitch on your carrier before building: 2.54 mm IDC is assumed."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1d6cb630-5c2c-47bd-9dfe-b6d7ff6b3e48")
	)
	(text "FIRMWARE NOTES\n- Enable BLSP1 as a 4-wire UART (GPIO0 TX, GPIO1 RX, GPIO2 CTS_N, GPIO3 RFR_N) in the device tree.\n- LTE_PWR_ON_CTRL (GPIO96): drive HIGH for >=25 ms, then LOW, to start the modem.\n- LTE_RESET_CTRL (GPIO98): emergency reset only; HIGH for >=20 ms. Power down with AT+CPOF.\n- Modem I/O runs at 1.8 V (VREF = VREG_L5_1P8), matching the SoC GPIO level."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 228.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4bdf0359-bec0-4e74-bf19-721fbeb9c421")
	)
	(text "OTHER HEADSET PARTS (no custom board needed)\n- Open-Q 624A SOM: mounted on the dev kit carrier (DF40 0.4 mm connectors need a 6+ layer fab).\n- LITE-ON WCBN3510A Wi-Fi/BT: already on the SOM; 3 MHF4 ports (2x Wi-Fi, 1x BT).\n- Taoglas AP.17E GPS: plug its MHF I cable straight into the SOM GNSS U.FL (port supplies +2.7 V bias).\n- Skywire LTE antennas: U.FL X1 = primary, X2 = diversity (max gain B2 8.01, B4 5.00, B12 8.70 dBi).\n- Micro SIM: slot J3 on the underside of the Skywire module.\n- Near-eye display: dev kit HDMI -> micro-OLED HDMI driver board, or dev kit J2 (4-lane DSI).\n- Camera: dev kit J4/J5 (4-lane CSI, JAE 41-pin) with an M12-mount sensor board."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 210.82 228.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e2cdf231-8ab6-4219-84ce-0481586789ae")
	)
